.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.example
*.md
!FRIENDS.md
# the judge reads the prose rubrics at run time; they are data, not prose for
# people, and the image without them grades nothing
!eval_tasks/fr/rubrics/*.md
results/
eval_tasks/*
!eval_tasks/mmlu_perm
# everything exam_build.py and judge.py read from the repo at run time: the
# harness task template, the per-topic rubrics and criteria files, the canary
# scripts, the delivered banks and the migrated skill suites. Leaving these
# out is invisible until the first click — which is how it shipped
!eval_tasks/fr
# the Everyday pilot's questions and task template (12a)
!eval_tasks/everyday
logs/
artifacts/
service.sqlite3*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
tests/
.github/
pyproject.toml
requirements-dev.txt
